(This contract implements a quantum-safe savings circle \(ROSCA\) using ML-DSA-87 signatures for authentication. It) Tj
T* (demonstrates good practices in quantum-resistant design with proper use of post-quantum cryptographic primitives.) Tj
T* (However, several medium-severity issues were identified related to potential bypasses in key registration,) Tj
T* (reentrancy risks in token interactions, and incomplete handling of security deposits during auction closure. The) Tj
T* (contract also lacks some input validation consistency for PQC signatures and assumes fixed precompile addresses.) Tj
